Zero point energy                ...      0.24451639 Eh     153.44 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.01118847 Eh       7.02 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00147327 Eh       0.92 kcal/mol
